      157.17,
      259.85,
      396.62,
      284.51
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.17,
      300.05,
      396.59,
      324.71
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Value Added Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.17,
      340.25,
      396.61,
      378.35
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 6 of the Value Added Tax Act, No.14 of 2002(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      392.09,
      396.6,
      428.27
    ],
    "text": "6. (1) The value of goods imported, otherthan the goods as prescribed by regulation shallbe the aggregate of \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      220.89,
      441.65,
      396.59,
      477.83
    ],
    "text": "(a)the value of the goods determined forthe purpose of custom duty increasedby ten per centum; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      220.89,
      491.33,
      396.59,
      589.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)the amount of any custom duty payablein respect of such goods with theaddition of any surcharge, cess, anyPorts and Airports Development Levypayable under the Finance Act, No. 11of 2002, and any excise duty payableunder the Excise (Special Provisions)Act, No. 13 of 1989 on such goods.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      602.09,
      396.6,
      675.47
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Minister may, from time to time,prescribe by regulation, the manner by whichthe value of goods specified in the regulationmade under subsection (1) is to be determined.Any such regulation made by the Minister shallbe approved by the Cabinet of Ministers and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
